```text
position 1: try 1 → counts {1:1, 2:1}
    position 2: try 1 → {1:0, 2:1} → position 3: 2   → 1 1 2
    position 2: try 2 → {1:1, 2:0} → position 3: 1   → 1 2 1
position 1: try 2 → counts {1:2, 2:0}
    position 2: try 1 → position 3: 1                → 2 1 1
```

Three permutations, none repeated, no filtering needed.

